WEBVTT

00:04:00.667 --> 00:04:01.934
So the next question is,

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:04.226
how do we make these tiny copper wires?

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.893
They're really small.

00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:08.393
Could it be that we go
to the hardware store,

00:04:08.417 --> 00:04:10.393
pick up a spool of copper wire,

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:13.393
get some wire cutters, a little clip-clip,

00:04:13.417 --> 00:04:16.792
saw it all up and then, bam --
we have our printed circuit board?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.268
No way.

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:21.726
These wires are way too small for that.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:25.375
And so we have to rely
on our friend: chemistry.

00:04:26.708 --> 00:04:29.809
Now, the chemical process
to make these tiny copper wires

00:04:29.833 --> 00:04:31.851
is seemingly simple.